{"id": "en_tsunami_p1", "total": 54.19, "segments": [{"text": "If the ocean suddenly pulls back far from the shore, do not wait.", "start": 0.0, "end": 3.66}, {"text": "Max stands on the dark beach when the tsunami siren screams into the night.", "start": 4.3, "end": 7.42}, {"text": "He has just minutes to survive before the killer wave arrives.", "start": 7.82, "end": 10.36}, {"text": "One. Do not drive because roads out of coastal towns jam fast.", "start": 11.06, "end": 14.38}, {"text": "About a third of evacuees get stuck in traffic in disasters.", "start": 14.74, "end": 16.88}, {"text": "Max leaves his car behind and trusts his feet on the asphalt.", "start": 17.52, "end": 19.94}, {"text": "Two. If you cannot go far, go up into a strong concrete building.", "start": 20.5, "end": 23.92}, {"text": "He spots the ten floor hotel looming over the dark shoreline.", "start": 24.3, "end": 26.54}, {"text": "Three. Climb above the fourth floor of the reinforced structure.", "start": 26.94, "end": 29.78}, {"text": "Max reaches the lobby and runs hard up the concrete stairs.", "start": 30.4, "end": 32.62}, {"text": "He pushes through the heavy fire door onto the safety of the roof.", "start": 33.1, "end": 35.42}, {"text": "Below him, the dark water slams into the street and swallows the cars.", "start": 35.92, "end": 38.94}, {"text": "He breathes out slowly and watches the roaring ocean from high above.", "start": 39.66, "end": 42.2}, {"text": "The first wave is often not the biggest, so he stays put.", "start": 42.82, "end": 45.08}, {"text": "It was the absolute safest plan for the terrifying night.", "start": 45.54, "end": 48.1}, {"text": "There was just one unexpected problem on the pitch black roof.", "start": 48.62, "end": 51.04}], "words": [["If", 0.0, 0.42], ["the", 0.42, 0.54], ["ocean", 0.54, 0.74], ["suddenly", 0.74, 1.18], ["pulls", 1.18, 1.48], ["back", 1.48, 1.7], ["far", 1.7, 1.98], ["from", 1.98, 2.16], ["the", 2.16, 2.26], ["shore,", 2.26, 2.42], ["do", 2.8